<title>USA: BOXING-MILLER RETAINS WBA CRUISERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-MILLER RETAINS WBA CRUISERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Florida 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Nate</p>
<p>Miller retained his World Boxing Association cruiserwight</p>
<p>title by stopping Alexandre Gurov of Ukraine at 1:54 of the</p>
<p>second round on Saturday.</p>
</text>
